# Normalize all text files to LF, in the index and the working tree, on every
# platform. This overrides per-machine core.autocrlf, so Windows checkouts stop
# converting to CRLF (and stop warning about it). The repo is all text today
# (md/json/toml/ps1/yaml: pwsh is fine with LF); add explicit rules here if
# binaries or CRLF-required files (.bat/.cmd) ever land.
* text=auto eol=lf
